# The monorepo root .gitignore blanket-ignores *.svg, but these two logo assets
# are REQUIRED fixture source: main.tsx/App.tsx import them, and without them the
# bundle's unresolved imports become throwing shims so the app never mounts.
# Re-include them here (a file glob, so this scoped negation is valid).
!src/assets/react.svg
!src/assets/vite.svg
